  "description": "Can this modern-day girl survive in the past? \n\nAfter a drunken encounter with a Buddha statue, So-Yeong Kim suddenly finds herself in the Silla Dynasty. Not only did she travel back in time, but she is the spitting image of Princess Sor-Yong, a mysterious princess with a huge secret. What will become of her, and will she be able to return home? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
